00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:12.720
County line and continuing for an additional&nbsp;
27 miles before the Guadaloop River dumps into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:18.560
Canyon Lake. With that, we had approximately&nbsp;
a 127mi area that we needed to work through.&nbsp;&nbsp;

